! GH_TOKEN is set in this terminal by something other than Devpit. gh uses this token instead of any signed-in account, wherever Devpit's rules do not pick one.
  Fix: If you did not mean to set it, remove it here with `Remove-Item Env:GH_TOKEN` (PowerShell) or `set GH_TOKEN=` (cmd), and from wherever sets it (a PowerShell profile, the system environment), then open a new terminal.
